# ai-workflow compactness

When changing MCP tools or search formatting in `packages/ai-workflow`:

1. Keep search defaults at max 8 hits and ≤3-line snippets (`format/compact.ts`).
2. Workflow tools should return ids/status/paths — not full markdown bodies.
3. Update `docs/mcp.md` + Intent skills if the tool inventory changes.
4. Do not add “dump entire repo” tools.
